Z||000000||redfiero||08-09-2001||06:58 AM||||A quick question about your swap:<P>Did you change the wiring harness for the gauges and the gauge assembly when you put your 2.8 in?  I'm doing a very similar swap and want to do it right the first time.<P>Thanks||||reg||1
Z||000001||88CoupeV6||08-09-2001||10:11 AM||||Hi, I did the same swap. You only have to change the engine harness. It connects to the ECM and to a connecter next to the battery. all the inside wires stay the same if you have an 86-88.  Good luck on your swap.<P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://people.ne.mediaone.net/fiero64/Fiero642.jpg">   <BR><B>Also 88 Yellow GT</B> :D  <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||7
